<title>BELGIUM: Dutch call informal ECOFIN on EMU jobs text.</title>
<headline>Dutch call informal ECOFIN on EMU jobs text.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch EU presidency have called for an informal meeting of finance ministers on Sunday evening in Amsterdam at 1900 GMT to discuss a jobs resolution for the EMU stability pact, an EU source said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The gathering, scheduled for 1900 GMT, will focus on two political resolutions expected to accompany the stability pact. One concerns employment while the other addresses the need for greater economic policy coordination among EMU members.</p>
<p>EU monetary affairs commissioner Yves-Thibault de Silguy said on Friday that the additions to the pact would serve as an &quot;economic pillar,&quot; allowing policy to shaped in a more concerted way.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
